  "direct_findings": [
    "All four current runs had ready VIO/map preconditions, but PX4 telemetry and localization did not remain fresh for the required 5 s; the harness made no EnableOffboard service call and sent no navigation action goal.",
    "Every current PX4 report recorded pre_flight_checks_pass=false for all observed vehicle_status samples. PX4 logs contained ekf2 missing data and system power unavailable warnings; the same initial warning strings also occur in historical run #200, so they do not isolate the current regression.",
    "Across #384–#387 the ROS clock span rate was 0.291–0.302×, estimator_flags and land_detected median receipt intervals were about 3.30–3.42 s, and control sample counts were zero. Bridge probe saw exactly one publisher on each PX4 control input topic, matching the exclusive uav_px4_bridge owner.",
    "Changing the scene, planner inflation, goal offset, or presence of the read-only spline observer did not change the preflight-gated outcome within these four runs. The historical #200 comparison differs in date and has no recorded immutable container digest; it cannot establish the cause of the rate difference.",
    "The three runs with a spline observer timed out without any spline or same-identity snapshot. No run produced an airborne body-envelope trajectory or executed a navigation goal."
